/**

@page page_exahype_extend-visualisation Extend the visualisation

\tableofcontents

Sometimes, you want to augment whatever ExaHyPE dumps. By default, we get the
current volumetric solution and all tracers. However, we have seen situations
where people wanted to write the face data for example or some postprocessed
data as well.


Each plotting step is a mere run through the mesh with a dedicated observer. By
default, this observer calls the plotting action sets for each solver, and it
invokes a tracer dump per tracer species. To add a further plotter, pass it to
the project's add_action_set_to_plot_solution().

*/
